27:T540,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I get a taxi from Jizan airport to my hotel?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Pre-book a private transfer. Jizan Airport (GIZ) is about 5 km from central Jizan. Send your flight number on WhatsApp and we confirm one fixed fare and meet you at arrivals."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I hire a private driver in Jizan for the day?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Tell us the date, hours and places you need to visit and we confirm a fixed fare on WhatsApp before you book."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How far is Jizan from Abha?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"About 200 km by road, roughly 2.5 hours of driving as the road descends from the Asir highlands to the coast. A private transfer is fixed-fare and door to door."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a Jizan airport taxi at night?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Transfers can be booked 24/7, including late arrivals. Share your flight number and we plan the pickup around your landing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can a company book transfers in Jizan with an invoice?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Email an RFQ for a written quote. Corporate invoicing can be arranged through our sister company."}}]}1c:["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-[#FAFAF7] text-[#1C1C1C] pb-24","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Taxi Service in Jizan\",\"description\":\"Book a private driver or transfer in Jizan for airport pickups from Jizan Airport (GIZ), hotel and business trips in the city, and the road up to Abha and the Asir highlands. Jizan sits on the hot Red Sea coastal plain, so a pre-booked car with a driver is the easy way to move between the airport, your hotel and onward destinations. Transfers can be booke